# Live H3 pose list. Columns: label map start_pose floor_y
# start_pose is the engine's --start-pose (capsule centre x,y,z, yaw, pitch; engine metres
# and degrees). The pawn settles to centre floor+0.81 (player.ts capsule halfHeight 0.8),
# so the live eye is floor+1.31; walk_inproc.sh times the in-process walk at that eye
# and at the sweep convention's floor+1.5.
#
# fc: measurement/frame-cost/poses.txt, verbatim (research.md's live occlusion-test runs).
fc:P1 occlusion-test -17.78,1.0,-13.8176,90,0 0
fc:P2 occlusion-test -17.78,1.0,-13.8176,90,15 0
fc:G1 occlusion-test -14.224,1.0,-13.8176,98,15 0
fc:G2 occlusion-test -17.78,1.0,-13.8176,64,0 0
fc:G3 occlusion-test -22.86,1.0,-7.62,82,0 0
fc:L2 occlusion-test -22.86,1.0,-13.8176,102,15 0
fc:C1 occlusion-test -3.2512,1.0,-3.2512,0,0 0
fc:C2 occlusion-test -7.62,1.0,-13.8176,90,0 0
fc:V1 occlusion-test -32.004,1.0,-10.16,90,0 0
# rd: content/dev/maps/stress-street.README.md sweep poses, verbatim (live street GPU; the
# offline 4K traces showed +29% at rd:promenade and +68% at rd:elevated on both caps).
rd:plaza stress-street -26.00,0.81,-40.00,0,0 0
rd:promenade stress-street -32.00,0.81,-90.00,90,0 0
rd:elevated stress-street -30.00,6.81,-96.00,90,0 6
rd:upperdeck stress-street -70.00,11.81,-100.00,0,0 11
# wk: walk-factor poses. The costliest 9l street-level and rooftop walks that stay on the
# portal path (no step-cap trip) on all three sides in the 9l sweeps:
#   g11.26.1@0 considered before / cap26 / cap19 = 4,083 / 4,164 / 4,155
#   roof:A0.s0.e@0/-15                            = 3,917 / 3,436 / 3,524
# Sweep eyes are floor+1.5 (floor 0 and 16 here); start centre = floor+0.81.
wk:g11.26.1@0 stress-street -32.247803,0.81,-20.754807,0,0 0
wk:roof:A0.s0.e@0/-15 stress-street -31,16.81,-55,0,-15 16
